 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Bella had entered twenty fashion competitions.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_00.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And lost every single one.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_01.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Until she discovered a silver dress hidden behind the dressing room mirrors.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_02.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was beautiful.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_03.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Covered in tiny glowing diamonds.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_04.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And when Bella put it on, the entire lobby went silent.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_05.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The runway theme was \"Future Royalty.\"",
   "speak": "The runway theme was Future Royalty.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_06.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bella walked onto the stage.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_07.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every judge gave her five stars.",
   "tag": "[excited]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_08.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "She won first place.",
   "tag": "[excited]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_09.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she entered another round.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_10.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_007"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "And won again.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_11.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "No matter what outfit she wore, the game kept giving her first place.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_12.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "At first, Bella loved it.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_13.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the other contestants stopped moving.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_14.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Their faces froze.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_15.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And a message appeared on the runway screen.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_16.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"WINNER SELECTED FOREVER.\"",
   "speak": "Winner selected forever.",
   "voice": "system",
   "fx": "giant",
   "tag": "[slowly, deep]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_17.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bella tried to leave the game.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_18.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the exit button was gone.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_19.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the silver dress began tightening around her.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_20.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "A spotlight turned on.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_21.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And a voice announced,",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_22.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"NEXT ROUND BEGINS IN TEN SECONDS.\"",
   "speak": "Next round begins in ten seconds.",
   "voice": "system",
   "fx": "giant",
   "tag": "[slowly, deep]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_23.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bella looked toward the audience.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_24.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every seat was empty.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_25.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Except one.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.62,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_26.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone was watching.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_27.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And they were wearing her original outfit.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.34,
   "audio": "build/ep22/local_lines/line_28.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_010"
   },
   "speak": "And they were, wearing her original outfit."
  }
 ],
